===Etymology===
{{compound|Stachel|Beere|t2=berry|lang=de}}. The term has been attested since at least the late 16th century; the 1607 dictionary ''Dictionnaire François-Allemand & Allemand-François'' contains the variant forms "Stachelbeer" and "Stichelbeer".

